Package: modfs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast file search built on the FSearch engine
    ModFS is a Flutter front-end over the FSearch C indexer (via Dart FFI).
    It supports regular expressions, wildcards, fast sorting, and instant
    results across millions of files. GPLv2-or-later fork of FSearch; the
    primary supported platform is macOS (this Debian packaging is community/
    unsupported).
